      "side": 1,
      "message": "The main thing is if the SYV682 is acting as a sink, we have to be very careful about changes to Control Register 1.  The failure we saw earlier in the Volteer project was a board brown-out because there was no battery connected and the EC was reset (either from a FW update, sysjump, or manual reset).\n\nI think this is a good change, so that syv682x_vbus_sink_enable() is responsible for setting HV_ILIM.",
